---
layout: base.njk
title: "Find agent skills that actually work in your agent"
desc: "We actually install each skill, plugin and MCP server in every agent that supports it (Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor, Pi), re-run nightly, and publish pass/fail with the reason. Plus the exact install command."
---
{% from "macros.njk" import card, pill %}
{% set demo = skills | where("slug","sentry") %}{% set demo = demo[0] or skills[0] %}
<section class="hero wrap">
 <div class="hl">
  <span class="eyebrow"><i class="live"></i>Install-tested in 5 real agents · last run {{ testing.runDate }}</span>
  <h1>Find agent skills that actually work in <em>your</em> agent.</h1>
  <p class="sub hero-line"><b>We don't copy READMEs.</b> We actually install each add-on in Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor and Pi (wherever it's supported), re-run it nightly, and tell you what passed, what broke, and why.</p>
  <div class="picker" role="radiogroup" aria-label="I use"><span class="pl">I use:</span>
   {% for a in site.agents %}<button type="button" role="radio" class="ag" data-agent="{{ a }}" aria-checked="false"><i class="ad" style="--c:{{ site.agentColor[a] }}"></i>{{ a|agentName }}</button>{% endfor %}</div>
  <label class="bigsearch"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
   <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search {{ skills.length }} skills, e.g. database, browser, deploy…" aria-label="Search skills"><kbd>/</kbd></label>
 </div>
 <div class="hr" aria-hidden="true"><div class="demo">
  <div class="ch">{% if demo.logo %}<img class="logo-img" src="{{ demo.logo }}" alt="" width="38" height="38">{% else %}<span class="mono">{{ demo.mono }}</span>{% endif %}<div class="cn"><h3>{{ demo.name }}</h3><span class="meta2">{{ demo.typeLabel }} · {{ demo.catLabel }}</span></div></div>
  <p>{{ demo.description | truncate(90) }}</p>
  <div class="dtabs">{% for a in site.agents %}<span data-a="{{ a }}" class="{{ demo.eff[a] }}">{{ a|agentName }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
  <div class="dcode"><span class="pr">$</span><code id="dcode"></code></div>
  <div class="dst" id="dst"></div>
  <script type="application/json" id="demodata">{{ {install:demo.install, compat:demo.eff} | json | safe }}</script>
 </div></div>
</section>
<section class="wrap stats" aria-label="Latest test run">
 <div><b>{{ testing.addons }}</b><span>add-ons install-tested</span></div><div><b>{{ testing.total }}</b><span>real installs in the latest run</span></div>
 <div><b>{{ testing.pass }}</b><span>passed ({{ testing.fail }} failed, reasons published)</span></div><div><b>{{ testing.runDate }}</b><span>last test run</span></div>
</section>
<section class="wrap how">
 <h2 class="sh">How we test (yes, actually)</h2>
 <ol><li><span>1</span><h3>We pull the add-ons</h3><p>From public lists: the official Claude Code, Codex and Grok Build marketplaces, the MCP reference servers and npm. {{ skills.length }} so far.</p></li>
 <li><span>2</span><h3>We run the real install, nightly</h3><p>In each agent's real CLI, in a throwaway sandbox with no accounts or keys. Then we check the agent actually loaded it.</p></li>
 <li><span>3</span><h3>We publish pass/fail + why</h3><p>Every result gets a date and a log excerpt. Failures stay up, not swept under the rug.</p></li></ol>
 <p class="muted">Why care? You don't burn an hour on an install that was never going to work. <a href="/how-we-test/">How we test, limits included →</a></p>
 <p class="muted">Honest labels: <span class="st tested">Tested ✓</span> our harness installed and loaded it in that agent. <span class="st failed">✕ Failed</span> it didn't, and the log says why. <span class="st documented">✓ Verified from docs</span> an official source publishes the install method. <span class="st unknown">Not yet tested</span> no docs and no test yet.</p>
</section>
<section class="wrap">
 <div class="rowh"><h2 class="sh">Featured</h2><span class="muted">In 3 or more official marketplaces</span></div>
 <div class="hrow">{% set n = 0 %}{% for s in skills %}{% if s.featured and n < 7 %}{% set n = n + 1 %}{{ card(s) }}{% if n == 2 %}<article class="card sponsor"><div class="ch"><span class="mono">+</span><div class="cn"><h3>Your skill here</h3><span class="meta2">Sponsored slot · 1 per row</span></div><span class="spon">Sponsored</span></div><p>Reach developers while they're choosing what to install. Always labeled, and never changes a status.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="/advertise/">Advertise →</a></article>{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
</section>
<section class="wrap browse" id="browse">
 <div class="rowh"><h2 class="sh">Browse</h2><button class="btn ghost fbtn" type="button" id="fopen">Filters</button></div>
 <div class="bl">
 <aside class="facets" id="facets"><div class="fh"><b>Filters</b><button type="button" id="fclose" aria-label="Close filters">✕</button></div>
  <fieldset><legend>Works in</legend><select id="agent" aria-label="Agent"><option value="">Any agent</option>{% for a in site.agents %}<option value="{{ a }}">{{ a|agentName }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></fieldset>
  <fieldset><legend>Status (for chosen agent)</legend><label><input type="radio" name="st" value="" checked> All</label><label><input type="radio" name="st" value="tested"> Tested ✓</label><label><input type="radio" name="st" value="documented"> Verified from docs</label><label><input type="radio" name="st" value="unknown"> Not yet tested</label></fieldset>
  <fieldset><legend>Type</legend>{% for t in skills|pluck("type")|uniq %}<label><input type="checkbox" name="type" value="{{ t }}"> {{ (skills|where("type",t))[0].typeLabel }} <em>{{ (skills|where("type",t)).length }}</em></label>{% endfor %}</fieldset>
  <fieldset><legend>Category</legend><select id="cat" aria-label="Category"><option value="">All categories</option>{% for c in skills|pluck("category")|uniq|sort %}<option value="{{ c }}">{{ (skills|where("category",c))[0].catLabel }} ({{ (skills|where("category",c)).length }})</option>{% endfor %}</select></fieldset>
  <button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="freset">Reset filters</button>
 </aside>
 <div class="results">
  <div class="rbar"><p class="count" aria-live="polite"><b id="n">{{ skills.length }}</b> results</p><label class="sort">Sort <select id="sort"><option value="compat">Most compatible</option><option value="az">A–Z</option></select></label></div>
  <p class="legend" aria-hidden="true"><span><b>CC</b> Claude Code</span><span><b>CX</b> Codex</span><span><b>GB</b> Grok Build</span><span><b>CU</b> Cursor</span><span><b>Pi</b> Pi</span><span>· solid = verified from docs, dashed = not yet tested</span></p>
  <div class="grid" id="grid">{% for s in skills %}{% if loop.index0 == 48 %}<template id="mc">{% endif %}{{ card(s) }}{% endfor %}{% if skills.length > 48 %}</template>{% endif %}</div>
  <div class="empty" id="empty" hidden><h3>No matches</h3><p>Try a broader search, a different agent, or a popular category: <a href="?cat=database#browse">database</a>, <a href="?cat=deployment#browse">deployment</a>, <a href="?cat=monitoring#browse">monitoring</a>.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="/submit/">Submit this skill →</a></div>
  <button class="btn ghost more" id="more" type="button">Load more</button>
 </div></div>
</section>
<section class="wrap teaser"><div class="rowh"><h2 class="sh">Compatibility at a glance</h2><a href="/matrix/">Full matrix →</a></div>
 <div class="heat">{% for a in site.agents %}{% set c = 0 %}{% for s in skills %}{% if s.compatibility[a]=='documented' %}{% set c = c + 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% set tc = 0 %}{% for s in skills %}{% if s.eff[a]=='tested' %}{% set tc = tc + 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
 <div class="hrow2"><span class="hn"><i class="ad" style="--c:{{ site.agentColor[a] }}"></i>{{ a|agentName }}</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:{{ (c/skills.length*100)|round(1) }}%"></i></div><span class="hc">{{ c }} verified from docs · <b class="tok">{{ tc }} tested ✓</b></span></div>{% endfor %}</div>
</section>
<section class="wrap" id="newsletter"><div class="news"><div><h2>SkillMaxx Weekly</h2><p>New skills, plugins and MCP servers across all 5 agents, plus whatever changed in the official docs. Every Tuesday.</p></div>
 <div class="bhw"><div class="bhf"><script async src="https://subscribe-forms.beehiiv.com/v3/loader.js" data-beehiiv-form="2487fe2a-f3f4-4080-86de-b965ea008f48"></script></div><noscript><a class="btn" href="https://skillmaxxs-newsletter.beehiiv.com/subscribe">Subscribe to SkillMaxx Weekly</a></noscript><p class="bhfb">Form not loading? <a href="https://skillmaxxs-newsletter.beehiiv.com/subscribe" rel="noopener">Subscribe on Beehiiv →</a></p></div></div></section>
{% set items = [] %}{% for s in skills %}{% set it = {"@type":"ListItem","position":loop.index,"url":site.url+"/skills/"+s.slug+"/","name":s.name} %}{% set items = (items.push(it), items) %}{% endfor %}{% set il = {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ItemList","name":"SkillMaxx directory of agent skills, plugins and MCP servers","numberOfItems":skills.length,"itemListElement":items} %}
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ il | json | safe }}</script>
